<view class="container">
  <view class="card">
    <view class="section-label">选择话题（单选）</view>
    <view class="topic-wrap">
      <view
        wx:for="{{topics}}"
        wx:key="key"
        class="topic-pill {{topicIndex === index ? 'topic-active' : ''}}"
        data-index="{{index}}"
        bindtap="onTopicTap"
      >{{item.label}}</view>
    </view>

    <view wx:if="{{topics[topicIndex].key === 'case_discussion'}}" class="privacy-tip">
      病例讨论请注意：禁止患者姓名、ID、影像号等可识别信息，务必脱敏后发布
    </view>

    <view class="form-col">
      <text class="form-label">标题</text>
      <input class="title-input" placeholder="30 字内" value="{{title}}" bindinput="onTitleInput" maxlength="30" />
    </view>

    <view class="form-col">
      <text class="form-label">正文</text>
      <textarea class="content-textarea" placeholder="1000 字内，分享你的经验与故事…" value="{{content}}" bindinput="onContentInput" maxlength="1000" />
    </view>

    <view class="image-block">
      <view
        wx:for="{{images}}"
        wx:key="*this"
        class="img-thumb"
        data-index="{{index}}"
        bindtap="onRemoveImage"
      >
        <image class="img-inner" src="{{item}}" mode="aspectFill" />
        <view class="img-del">✕</view>
      </view>
      <view wx:if="{{images.length < 3}}" class="img-add" bindtap="onChooseImage">
        <view class="img-plus">+</view>
        <text class="img-count">{{images.length}}/3</text>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="identity-row">
      <text>身份显示</text>
      <view class="identity-opts">
        <view class="identity-opt {{!isAnonymous ? 'identity-on' : ''}}">实名</view>
        <view class="identity-opt {{isAnonymous ? 'identity-on' : ''}}" bindtap="onAnonymousToggle">匿名</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="risk-tip">
    提交即检测：涉政、黄赌毒、暴力及患者隐私等内容将被拦截
  </view>

  <button class="btn-primary submit-btn" disabled="{{submitting}}" bindtap="onSubmit">
    {{submitting ? '发布中…' : '发布'}}
  </button>
</view>
